<p>Upgrade the target turret, granting it <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100%</acronym> increased maximum life and enhanced abilities based on type:</p><p>Steamgun: Gains a second steamgun dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 33%, 42%, 50%</acronym> damage, and every 3 turns will fire a rocket dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">160%, 238%, 301%, 352%, 400%</acronym> steamgun damage as fire in radius 2.</p><p>Flame: Increases damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 33%, 42%, 50%,</acronym> range by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2,</acronym> and every 3 turns will project a vortex of superheated air that drags targets within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> towards the turret as well as dealing normal flamethrower damage.</p><p>Medic: Increases healing on affected targets by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 33%, 42%, 50%,</acronym> and has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 15%, 22%, 28%, 33%</acronym> chance to cleanse a negative effect each turn.</p>